sequenceDiagram
    participant C as MCP Client
    participant S as MCP Server
    participant V as Schema Validator
    participant L as RPM Limiter
    participant R as Retry Policy
    participant P as Agnes Provider
    participant A as Agnes API

    C->>S: call generate_image
    S->>V: validate request
    V-->>S: normalized request
    S->>L: acquire token by size
    L-->>S: permit
    S->>R: execute with retry policy
    R->>P: generate(request)
    P->>A: POST /v1/images/generations
    A-->>P: URL or Base64 response
    P-->>R: normalized provider result
    R-->>S: result or typed error
    S-->>C: MCP JSON envelope
